LSMonteCarlo modern Fortran translation
=======================================

This project is a derivative work of LSMonteCarlo 1.0 by Mikhail A. Beketov,
originally published as an R package in 2013.

Original package:
  Title: American options pricing with Least Squares Monte Carlo method
  Author and maintainer: Mikhail A. Beketov
  Version: 1.0
  License: GPL-3

The original package is retained without modification under
original/LSMonteCarlo-1.0. The supplied source archive is retained under
provenance/LSMonteCarlo-master.zip.

The modern Fortran translation is distributed under GPL-3.0-only, preserving
the original package's license. See LICENSE for the complete license text.

The translation was produced independently from the supplied R source. It is
not an official release by the original author.
